ames>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Glucose ulitilzation during flight of honeybee (<italic>Apis mellifera</italic>) workers, drones and queens</article-title><source>J Insect Physiol</source><year>1993</year><volume>39</volume><fpage>959</fpage><lpage>967</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="b17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Grogan</surname><given-names>DE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Pollen proteases: their potential role in insect digestion</article-title><source>Insect Biochem</source><year>1979</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>309</fpage><lpage>313</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="b18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Harrison</surname><given-names>JF</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Flight respiration and energetics</article-title><source>Annu Rev Physiol</source><year>2000</year><volume>62</volume><fpage>179</fpage><lpage>205</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10845089</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Harrison</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Caste-specific changes in honeybee flight capacity</article-title><source>Physiol Zool</source><year>1986</year><volume>59</volume><fpage>175</fpage><lpage>187</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="b20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Holt</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>The genome sequence of the malaria mosquito <italic>Anopheles gambiae</italic></article-title><source>Science</source><year>2002</year><volume>298</volume><fpage>129</fpage><lpage>149</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12364791</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b21"><citation citation-type="journal"><collab>Honey Bee Genome Sequencing Consortium</colla